================================================================================
Go and npm dependencies
================================================================================

Deal Onboarding depends on, but does not redistribute, the Go modules pinned
in go.mod / go.sum (chi, chi/cors, golang.org/x/crypto) and the npm packages
pinned in frontend/package.json / package-lock.json (React, react-markdown and
its remark/micromark tree, flatpickr, SheetJS `xlsx`, and the Vite / vitest /
TypeScript toolchain). Each is fetched at build time under its own license
(MIT, BSD-3-Clause or Apache-2.0). flatpickr's stylesheet is bundled into the
production CSS by Vite from node_modules; it is not vendored here. Run
`go-licenses` and `npx license-checker` in your build environment for the
authoritative list of the exact versions you installed.

The publisher catalog in catalogs/publisher-catalog.json and the standard
lists under lists/ are synthetic placeholders authored by ElcanoTek; no
customer, partner or exchange data is included. See lists/README.md.
